---
description: StudyDrill rules for any work in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow docs/AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md before doing anything in this repo.
Before writing or changing any question, read docs/QUESTION_RULES.md.
For tasks, follow the matching guide in docs/workflows/ (setup, add-questions, make-mock, mock-review).
After any change to src/ or scripts/, run `npm run check` and `npm test`; both must pass before you finish.
Never weaken scripts/check-bank.js or the tests. Never change a question id or the storageKey. Never invent a fact. In dynamic questions, every changing value comes from a value type in M. Never put personal details in any file.
